_ canvas-effects-matrix
    - angle F64
    - zoom F64
    - center Point

rotated.translate(center).scale(Dimensions(zoom, zoom)).translate(Point(-center.x, -center.y))

.. rotated = Matrix().rotate(angle as Degrees, center)

